From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:08:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: samsung: Describe Tensor G4 eUSB2 PHY

Add the Tensor G4 eUSB2 compatible using the existing three-clock,
two-supply and optional repeater interface. Keep the Exynos2200
register-interface fallback; the specific G4 match selects its bias
and calibration sequence in a G4-aware driver.

Stock zumapro's HSI0 low-voltage rail is named vdd075-supply and wired
to m_ldo8_reg. Describe the digital supply without fixing every
compatible to Exynos2200's 0.88 V. This changes no voltage constraint,
board node or regulator programming.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zumapro/+/8831630eee2ad095b85ed452944e6353940966a5/dts/zumapro-common.dtsi#73
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/phy/samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy.yaml          | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy.yaml
index f63210224..f382d3e73 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy.yaml
@@ -18,7 +18,9 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - const: samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy
       - items:
-          - const: google,zuma-eusb2-phy
+          - enum:
+              - google,zuma-eusb2-phy
+              - google,zumapro-eusb2-phy
           - const: samsung,exynos2200-eusb2-phy
 
   reg:
@@ -49,7 +51,7 @@ properties:
 
   vdd-supply:
     description:
-      Phandle to 0.88V regulator supply to PHY digital circuit.
+      Phandle to the regulator supply to the PHY digital circuit.
 
   vdda12-supply:
     description:
